; bal -V --unrealized tests one posting at a time whether the report can
; bring the posting's cost to the commodity in which it values the posting's
; holding.  Five AAPL are bought for euros, in which -V values them, so the
; purchase is booked at its cost of 500.00 EUR.  Two are sold for dollars,
; which -V leaves as they are, so the sale contributes the two AAPL
; themselves, which the report values at the report date at 225.00 EUR
; instead of the 200.00 EUR they cost.  Equity:Unrealized Gains therefore
; holds the 37.50 EUR gain on the three AAPL still held and the 25.00 EUR
; by which the price of the two sold rose between their purchase and their
; sale, and the report does not foot.  Before the balance report valued
; postings at cost it printed no unrealized row, since no price changes
; after the last posting, and did not foot either.  Under -X EUR the report
; converts the dollars to euros, books the sale at its cost and foots.

P 2024/01/01 EUR $1.10

2024/01/01 Buy euros
    Assets:Euros             1000.00 EUR @ $1.10
    Assets:Checking

2024/01/10 Buy shares with euros
    Assets:Brokerage            5 AAPL @ 100.00 EUR
    Assets:Euros

P 2024/03/01 AAPL $130.00
P 2024/03/01 EUR $1.20

2024/03/15 Sell shares for dollars
    Assets:Brokerage           -2 AAPL {100.00 EUR} @ $135.00
    Assets:Checking          $270.00

test bal -V --unrealized --now 2024/04/01
            $-830.00
          837.50 EUR  Assets
          337.50 EUR    Brokerage
            $-830.00    Checking
          500.00 EUR    Euros
          -62.50 EUR  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
            $-830.00
          775.00 EUR
end test

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --now 2024/04/01
          145.83 EUR  Assets
          337.50 EUR    Brokerage
         -691.67 EUR    Checking
          500.00 EUR    Euros
         -145.83 EUR  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test
